    "The proposed extension will have a single storey and extend beyond the rear wall of the original dwellinghouse by more than 4 metres, in conflict with Paragraph A.1 (f) (i)  of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).",
